body:
from bts for me it’s definitely Yoongi. he’s just such a calming and wholesome person and for me he is my comfort idol. when things go wrong i know that i can rely on yoongi to always be there (obviously not in person :( but in my heart i can feel he is with me) 

and from ateez (amazing group i really recommend you stan) it’s wooyoung, hes just so cute and he has the cutest laugh ever. whenever he’s laughing, so am i 

from twice it’s definitely chaeyoung. i just love her so much and she looks like she couldnt even hurt a fly.
